.SH NAME
hed\-man \- View and search system man pages without leaving the editor.
Renders a page into a read\-only buffer (titled [man ()]) so you can
scroll, search, and yank from it like any other buffer.
.PP
View and search system man pages without leaving the editor.
Renders a page into a read\-only buffer (titled
\f[CR][man <topic>(<sect>)]\f[R]) so you can scroll, search, and yank
from it like any other buffer.
